  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Women General contribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Women&apos;s mandate is to coordinate and accelerate the promotion of gender equality and women&#xbf;s empowerment through its 3-fold mandate: 1) normative - to support inter-governmental bodies in their formulation of policies, global standards and norms, 2) operational - to help Member States to implement these standards, standing ready to provide suitable technical and financial support to those countries that request it, and to forge effective partnerships with civil society, and 3) coordinating - to hold the UN system accountable for its own commitments on gender equality, including regular monitoring of system-wide progress, and help ensure that the UN system has the capacity it needs to meet those commitments.</narrative>
  </description>
